00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:27.987
Where do things stand

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.489
when that one's an announcement coming?

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:31.825
Well, he said he intends to run

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:36.696
