00:01:36.729 --> 00:01:38.798
I think, you know, he's been so busy with

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.302
being in Ukraine

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.370
handling some of the crises at home.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:46.940
