Well, it's

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:01.588
Joe's really it's Joe's decision.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:04.891
And we support whatever he wants to do.

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:07.560
If he were there,

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.562
if he wants to do something else.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.464
Were there too

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:14.000
is there any chance at this point

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.301
that he's not going to run

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.572
Not in my book.

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:21.174
You're all for it.

00:02:21.174 --> 00:02:24.177
I'm all for it, of course.

00:02:24.444 --> 00:02:25.178
So as we're reading

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:26.312
all of these tea leaves,

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.247
this is just another

00:02:27.247 --> 00:02:28.381
