00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:43.596
Yeah, we spent the last five days

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:45.064
traveling through Africa, stops

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:45.832
in Namibia

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:46.432
