00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:03.950
when she traveled down to rural

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.051
a rural village

00:03:05.051 --> 00:03:06.986
in Kenya to see firsthand

00:03:06.986 --> 00:03:09.222
the impact of drought in the region.

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:09.923
There were hundreds

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:11.424
gathered there to receive health

00:03:11.424 --> 00:03:12.859
and nutritional services,

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:13.927
