00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.395
firsthand what these people

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:16.262
were experiencing.

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:17.197
And as we were there

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:18.398
every step of the way.

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.999
And we'll be bringing that to you

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:21.167
a bit later this week.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:22.302
Oh, interesting.

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:23.203
Thank you very much.

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:24.804
